            <title>[LU-21134] sanityn test_4: Blocks don't match 1, 11 on ZFS DNE</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-21134</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;sanityn test_4 (fstat validation on multiple mount points) fails intermittently on review-dne-zfs-part-5 (ZFS, DNE, el10.2) with:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;  Blocks don't match 1, 11&lt;br/&gt;
  sanityn test_4: @@@@@@ FAIL: test_4 failed with 1&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;multifstat on $DIR1/f4 and $DIR2/f4 sees a different st_blocks on the two mount points (1 vs 11), likely ZFS block accounting not yet settled when the second mount stats the file.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Seen twice in 30 days, both lustre-reviews review-dne-zfs-part-5 on master, on unrelated changes: 60995 ps23 (2026-10-31, session 53f309e5-bbf5-4a3c-90a1-799e6a450ad7) and 58253 ps25 (2026-11-05, session deb8b5a2-1569-48f6-8a94-9466f6c13499). Pass rate on that config about 99.9% (2 of 1591 runs failed); 0 failures on review-dne-part-5 (ldiskfs), full-part-3 or other branches. Change 58253 only touches lfs mirror extend in lfs.c and sanity-flr, so it cannot affect this test.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Older &lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-1843" title="sanityn test_4 FAIL on OFD + Ldiskfs" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-1843"&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-1843&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-221" title="sanityN.sh test_4 failed" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-221"&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-221&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-415" title="sanityn test_4: Mtimes don't match 1308053256, 1308068405" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-415"&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-415&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-2087" title="sanityn FAIL: test_4 failed with 1" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-2087"&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-2087&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; are resolved tickets for other causes of sanityn test_4 failures.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Raised by Patch Watcher run pw-engineer-58253-ps25-84cba733ca60 on &lt;a href="https://review.whamcloud.com/58253" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://review.whamcloud.com/58253&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
